{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-common-biology-04","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"biology","number":4,"points":2,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"번역·RNA·코돈","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene"],"stem":"그림은 리보솜의 50S와 30S 소단위체(subunit)가 mRNA, \n아미노아실-tRNA와 결합한 모습을 나타낸 것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 50S 소단위체에 있는 rRNA가 펩티드결합을 촉매한다.\nㄴ. 번역 종결 시 방출인자(release factor)는 E 자리에 결합한다.\nfMet는 P 자리에서 mRNA의 개시코돈 AUG를 \nㄷ. fMet-tRNA\n인식한다.\nㄹ. 단백질 합성 시 mRNA에 30S 소단위체보다 50S 소단위체가 \n먼저 결합한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":483,"height":357,"region":0,"bbox":[73.88,62.503,193.2,142.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-common-biology-04/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":323,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,262.103,310.4,129.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-common-biology-04/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,595.582],"width":328.98,"height":443.285,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[73.88,62.503,193.2,142.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.28,262.103,310.4,129.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"4. 그림은 리보솜의 50S와 30S 소단위체(subunit)가 mRNA, ","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.901,12.276],"spans":[{"text":"4.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,10.0,1